<description>&lt;p&gt;A building fire on Phuket island killed 11 people and injured dozens, prompting an investigation into its cause. Cambodian leaders adopted a declaration in Phnom Penh urging Thailand to resume border demarcation, while Thailand objected to Cambodia's wording on displaced people at an ASEAN meeting. Hun Manet thanked France and President Macron for efforts to resolve the Cambodia-Thailand border dispute, and the Thai army accused Cambodia of politicising a border temple display. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxObE16UkxwUFBkdy1UTHd1RDhoUHdTRGxDeE1pM1RuaG9sYk1ES2MxSXpoWGlmMjZvd3lrUld5T0hlRnNhYUhCNHBtN1llV3ZQNXJUU2hfUDBuWks1bl9XMWkxTUhXSFlpTzBLY3FqUlNweGYzQnFudVNTZG5wQkhHbTJaMHdEbUctaEZodXhncjFONm5aSzZzMF9wVkNkUG1xWGtVSHU0NE03RUJUc3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPcV9iX1ZCU3dYNVJRTmtLcTR6dk9VUDFUbGlTb1Q1MjFYVDRKc00wcHI4dEFhZ3RCUV8zOVFlOTBJME5oeDlmUklLQUx2TlRLdkQtVElMa3p2eHlYZGMwOEZVWHlMMk9WdW1jTjlyRF9MVjVROTV3VHY1UTdXbFNiNUF2ZGxMWUlaZnNSRDVtNGMwYnVO?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bol News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPTUVVSFN2VXFLaThjRVZlRTRTNk5WSWtyMWFDUmxac21KeEl6LU5TUnM1TEtleFRJZk1BQksycUFqUlIyWkVwOVpfeUlCTnozNGt0dFphZ3FOdHJsMC1uNThNbWJSVm9xbVMyRUQ4UUNuQm9QVzVySkUtSS11NW5QNHI5bVl4Sm1iZGx0RmhaYlRoRkdhWHFsVkFSZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dunyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxONkotZ2x1SnRJVGE4LXQ2X0xfcldUcUxaTFRsWC1GZDVUbGFTY3h2MlRwbkdvUHp2aTBJUEVrb0tPQXNsQTBmR2Q0bl9URDNaWFpablY4dUhEd2szR2hqc1NCdDFyNk9tSE03Zl9Td3NyUDVTN3J2eXVDbnhoTXBnazZwQzVMbmdGOUh6cXRMX0VLb09mbkVBcEs1LTE5V2N2QjhMOWd